+            print(f'{m:22s} CNN={r["mean_baseline_cnn"]} '
+                  f'Candidate={r[f"mean_{method}"]} '
+                  f'Improved={r["n_improved"]}/{r["n_valid"]}')
+PYEXTRACT
+```
